      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خادّهُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>He opposed him, being opposed by
him:</i> (A:) or <i>he was,</i> or <i>became, angered,</i> or
<i>enraged, against him, and opposed him in his
deed,</i> or <i>work.</i> (K.)

